<title>UK: Abbey Nat's Cater offer wholly unconditional.</title>
<headline>Abbey Nat's Cater offer wholly unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British banking group Abbey National Plc said on Thursday its cash offer for financial services group Cater Allen Holdings Plc was now wholly unconditional in all respects.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that as of yesterday it had received acceptances in respect of some 28 million shares, approximately 85.42 percent of Cater Allen's issued share capital.</p>
<p>Abbey National last month made an agreed bid for Cater Allen, valuing the company at 191 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
